window.products.push({"id":416175,"name":"WILLOW WEAVE Heavy Duty Fireplace Tools Set Firewood Storage Rack Log Carrier Holder Fireplace and Stove Accessories, Great Looking Plenty Loads Wood ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a5x4-q8sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PATENTED!!! MEASUREMENTS：16.25\" W x 11.5\" D x 27.5\" H, the firewood rack is compact, aesthetically pleasing and very sturdy. The fireplace tools set is reasonably sized for a formal living area and holds enough wood (5-6 bundles of wood) to make an evening of casual burning much less time consuming. The fireplace stand set is with thick powder coatings, chip resistant and the metal is a respectable gauge, the welds are solid beads, strong enough to hold the weight of the wood. Max weight loading is 180 lbs. TOOLS INCLUDED: Fireplace tools are secured on each side of the bin holder, well made of wrought iron metal, solid and ergonomic, have a nice weight. You can expect many years use out of the rack and tools. The four tools are a plus as with logs and sticks coming into the house there are always messes to clean up and bigger logs to push into the stove opening. VENTILATION DESIGN: The firewood rack bin stands 2\" from the ground, to keep ventilation and isolate dampness, dry wood for easy burning.The log rack works great to nicely stack a lot amount of wood without having it sit on the floor. EASY TO ASSEMBLE: Assembly is as easy as installing eight screws and nuts. Log rack will be together in less than 5 minutes, and get put to work immediately. INDOOR / OUTDOOR WOOD RACK: The log holder is an attractive decor piece that compliments both metal wood stoves or any fireplace. The matte black hearth center matches most fireplace screens, is a fine addition to your living room. The wood rack is good for holding logs to burn immediately and long term storage purposes. Easy to pick up & use in different rooms/locations, this is the ideal firewood storage solution for patio or deck. It is extremely functional with a minimal footprint.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a5x4-q8sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WILLOW WEAVE","source_asin":"B09JZL5TDG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416175","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JZL5TDG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JZL5TDG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
