window.products.push({"id":416216,"name":"Fruit and Vegetable Washing Machine, Ultrasonic Fruit Cleaner Portable Crodless Fruit Purifier with USB Charging Base Food Grade Cleaning Machine with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OaeDKfLEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Food Grade Purification Technology - Fruits vegetables may be polluted in growth and transportation. The harmful substances will adhere to the surface and very difficult to clean thoroughly. Fruit cleaner useing water as raw material to achieve high-efficiency purification in two steps: 1.Produce ultrasonic to make harmful substances attached to the surface fall off. 2.Electrolysis of water produces OH - and H+. OH- and Cl combine into HClO which will deeply degrade harmful ingredient. Easy To Clean & 2 Modes - Just press the switch to turn the fruit and vegetable washing machine on. Fruit cleaner will finish the work in 5 minutes (please extend the working time if there is more food to be washed) and will purify more than 99% of residual harmful ingredient and prolong the storage time. Fruit purifier has two working modes: ultrasonic+releasing OH ions; Only OH ions are released. Please refer to the manual for specific operation methods. Portable & Rechargeable - The size of fruit and vegetable washing machine is 5.9 * 2.2 * 1.7 inch (15 * 5.55 * 4.4 cm)，small and portable, convenient storage and suitable for outdoor travel or camping.The fruit cleaner purifier built-in 2400mAh rechargeable battery, can be used about 30-40 times when fully charged. At the same time, it is also equipped with a dust cover to prevent dust from entering the machine when you don't use fruit purifier, very convenient ! Widely Use - The fruit and vegetable washing machine can purify fruits, vegetables, meat, aquatic products and other foods, the cleaned food can extend the storage time. Of course , It can also clean tableware, kitchen utensils,glasses and jewelry to remove dust and other attachments on the surface. Healthy Life - Fruit and vegetable cleaning machine can purify food, which not only extends the shelf life of food, but also makes food safer and our life healthier. Especially when we prepare food materials for children, we will pay more attention to the safety and freshness of food, so this is also an ideal gift for kids, mom and any familys.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OaeDKfLEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WOODEN TEETHER","source_asin":"B0BHH79P8L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHH79P8L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHH79P8L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
