window.products.push({"id":416248,"name":"Amtoodopin Psychedelic Moon Tapestry Trippy Tree Tapestry Galaxy Space Tapestry Starry Sky Tapestry Mystic Planet Mountain Tapestry Wall Hanging for L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71buqyR54AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: The Starry Moon Tree tapestry is well crafted with lightweight polyester fabric, very soft and comfortable, perfect for hanging. The color does not fade after a long time of use, Give your space a new feeling and style. Size: M-- W59.1\"× H51.2\"; L-- W78.7\"× H59.1\"; XL-- W92.5\"× H70.8\". Please choose the suitable size for different using. Unique Design: How beautiful this night nature landscape tapestry is! The moon is as big as a jade plate. The bright star river shines on the full moon. The tree of life stands between the mountains and echoes with the moonlight. What a warm and peaceful night! Versatile Usage: This Starry Moon Tree tapestry is widely used as a wall hanging for wall, ceiling, ins background decor, it also can be used as bedspread, bedcover, table cloth, beach towel, shawl and so on. Wash Guide: The mountain sun tapestry should be washed by hand or machine in cold water. Dry in cool ventilated place. Don’t bleach and hot iron.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71buqyR54AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amtoodopin","source_asin":"B08HCWZSFT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HCWZSFT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HCWZSFT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":416249,"name":"WMF Corkscrew Clever & More 20Cm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zFxQSHAfS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This 20cm WMF Clever & More Corkscrew features a classic winged style in a stainless steel construction with black accents. Simply balance the corkscrew on top of the cork and twist the top handle so the screw goes in. As the screw spirals down into the cork, the arms slowly come up on both sides. Push both arms down to the closed position, and the cork comes out effortlessly. The handle also is designed to open bottle caps. Made from the highest of quality materials the Clever & More corkscrew is smooth to the touch. The chrome plated handles compliment the black body providing an interesting contrast, a hardwearing product that can be complimented with a variety of pieces available within the Clever & More range. As with all WMF products, the Clever & More corkscrew comes with a guarantee against manufacturing and material defect. Completed with a high quality gift box, WMF provide a product ideal for a gift. As a brand WMF is known for its versatile stylish range of products and reliability in quality and finish. For over 150 years WMF has been making cooking, dining and drinking a real experience whilst maintaining professional standards and progressing manufacturing technologies. Providing high quality products in a variety of different styles and designs to meet each individual taste and continuously offering cutting edge designs from Art Nouveau and Art Deco right up to today’s contemporary contours and designs. Well-known designers from all over the world are in constant search of innovative ideas for us, whilst our product development keeps track of the customs of different cultures world-wide. This enables us to detect trends and to develop designs which break away from usual precipitations. Numerous international design awards prove our success. Renowned for innovative products and designs, WMF strive to develop an extensive range of products which inspire and make cooking, dining and drinking an event.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zFxQSHAfS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WMF","source_asin":"B0B9RNM1GC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9RNM1GC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9RNM1GC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
