window.products.push({"id":416340,"name":"bbf Studio C 42\" Desk Return in Storm Gray - Engineered Wood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":222.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31HID5qMNOL._AC_.jpg","description":"Expand your office with the Bush Business Furniture Studio C 42W Desk Return. Designed to attach to either side of your Studio C desk (sold separately), the Return creates a left or right-handed layout so you can work in comfort. Add the coordinating 60W or 72W desks to create an L shaped or U shaped configuration perfect for those who love to multitask. The roomy Return surface adds plenty of workspace and resists scratches and stains with a thermally fused laminate finish. Available in White or Storm Gray, the stylish finish options make a welcome addition to any office. This contemporary office furniture comes with a 10 Year Warranty and meets ANSI/BIFMA quality test standards. See the full collection for coordinating items available to make your office your own with Studio C. American made with U.S. and imported parts.Features :- Finish: Storm Gray- Material: Laminate Over Engineered Wood, Steel, Metal, Plastic, Thermally Fused Laminate Over Engineered Wood- Thermally fused laminate finish fends off scratches and stains to protect the Desk Return- Must be attached to Studio C 60\" or 72\" Desks (sold separately) to create L or U Shaped configurations- Can make a left or right-handed layout by attaching to either side of desk- Clean lines and extended modesty panel provide a professional feel- Accepts Keyboard Tray (sold separately) to complete your office- Available in contemporary White and Storm Gray finishes to fit any work environment- Meets ANSI/BIFMA quality test standards for performance and safety- Commercial quality backed by 10 Year Warranty.Specifications :- Product Dimensions : 29.84\" H x 41.65\" W x 23.34\" D- Product Weight : 77 lbs- Assembly Required : Yes- Product Color : Storm Gray.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31HID5qMNOL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bbf","source_asin":"B083ZX76Q9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083ZX76Q9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083ZX76Q9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
