window.products.push({"id":416407,"name":"Large Kids Lunch Box, Insulated Lunch Bag for Girls Boys Teens Toddlers Cute School Lunch Tote with Shoulder Strap, VONXURY","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i4Oqhr4UL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM MATERIALS & UNIQUE DESIGN: VX VONXURY reusable lunch bag made of high quality and water resistant polyester exterior,sturdy and easy to clean.The non-toxic insulated material keeps meal warm & fresh for 6.5 hours. With 3 colorful and imaginative prints to choose from, every lunch bag is personality that makes it fun to carry around.Suitable for kids from 3 to 18 years old. LARGE CAPACITY & WELL ORGANIZED: Compatible with most kids lunch boxes.This lunch bag measures 9.8 *3.7*8.3inch/ 25*9.5*21cm(L*W*H) and features a spacious main compartment with a mesh pocket inside,which is large enough to store a lunch box, a water bottle,several snacks and fruits. The front exterior pocket is easy accessed for the utensils or napkins.Both of the drink holder pockets on the side could fit a 16 oz water bottle well. MULTI-PORPOSE & PORTABLE: Our lunch tote features a 25.6-48.8 inch/65-124cm( Minimum length to max length)strap which is adjustable and removable to help you find your best fit. With a adjustable and removable shoulder strap, handle and hooks,the lunch tote provides versatile options to hold by hand/shoulder or attach the lunch bag to a backpack for hands-free transport. REUSABLE & ENVIRONMENTALLY FRIENDLY: Free of PVC, BPA and phthalates, making our lunch boxes an environmentally friendly choice. The outer durable material is scratch-resistant and tear-resistant, it can be used for several years. Using our resable lunch box is a environmentally friendly approach to lunch time. Reduce waste and save money! IDEAL GIFT & SUITABLE FOR MANY OCCASIONS:This lightweight lunch bag is not only suitable for kindergarten,primary school,middle school and college. It also could be used as picnic bag, snack bag. Suitable for the young groups, include women, men and teens, specially designed for students, children and toddlers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i4Oqhr4UL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VX VONXURY","source_asin":"B09NDMDCS9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NDMDCS9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NDMDCS9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
