window.products.push({"id":416484,"name":"Wooden Salt and Pepper Grinder Set, Black Salt and Pepper Mill, Manual Spice Grinders with Adjustable Ceramic Rotor & Stainless Steel Core, Refillable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61As7LPNkkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PREMIUM MATERIALS】 TOPAHGOD salt and pepper mills are made of premium natural oak, sturdy and durable, ECO-friendly and healthy. Using uniquely designed ceramic rotors and stainless steel gaskets with high hardness and high wear resistance. The oak pepper grinders have a wood cover that can block the contact between air and the seasoning, so it will not let the seasoning get damp and can grind the fresh seasoning anytime. Believe you will love this healthy and durable spice grinder. 【SIMPLE OPERATION】When using the spice grinder, you just need to remove the top, easily load salt or pepper into the salt grinder and pepper grinder, and turn the adjustable nut on the spice grinder to customize the coarseness, rotate clockwise into fine particles, rotate counterclockwise to grind into coarse particles. The grinder will produce a fine grind that will ensure an even spread over your meals. The simple operation gives you more time to focus on cooking and enjoy cooking. 【EASY DISTINGUISH & EASY TO REFILL】The chic brass knob of the salt and pepper grinder has laser engraved \"S\" and \"P\" on the top, \" S \" and \" P \" stand for Salt and Pepper, which makes us easily find the seasoning we need. The novelty wooden salt and pepper mill set is easy to refill and doesn't take a lot of time and effort, you just easily refill your hand grinder with salt or pepper simply by unscrewing the oak top. The wide-mouth design prevents spills and messes as you fill, convenient and fast. 【WIDE APPLICABILITY】This ergonomics streamlined oakwood pepper mill salt and pepper grinder, you can hold it in hand comfortably without worrying about it dropping out when using. This grinder is suitable for use with a variety of spices such as pepper, sea salt, and Himalayan salt, which is a good helper for kitchens, restaurants, parties, and picnics. If you are looking for a convenient way of adding your favorite spices to your meals, then look no further than our oakwood pepper grinder. 【PERFECT GIFT】Wood pepper mill body looks elegant and smart on your table at all times and charming. Savvy cooks like you will rave about this wood salt and pepper grinder set. Do you have a friend or family who is a cooking enthusiast? And would you like to help them foster their love for cooking and the use of spices? Then you can try one of our oakwood pepper grinders that make for a perfect gift to boost their passion for cooking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61As7LPNkkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bochionyu","source_asin":"B09ZTSMNNG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416484","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZTSMNNG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZTSMNNG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":416485,"name":"Noble Things Proverbs 31 Woman Ceramic Christian Coffee Mug for Women – Purple and Gold Inspirational Coffee Cup and Christian Gifts (12-Ounce Ceramic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G5kMiKAsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DAILY ENCOURAGEMENT: Drink in God’s Word. This motivational coffee mug is not only functional; it also serves as a strong and powerful reminder each time you take a moment to drink and meditate on the truth from Scripture of the Lord’s tender care and faithful promises to you found in His unchanging word. BIBLE VERSE COFFEE MUG: Christian Art Gift’s Noble Things Bible verse mug features Proverbs 31:29 “Many women do noble things but you surpass them all” beautifully designed in purple with gold foil accents. Finished with a white high gloss exterior and interior. ENCOURAGING GIFT FOR WOMEN: This encouraging gift for women Christian coffee mug is made of durable ceramic with lead-free and cadmium-free glaze that ensures long-term and carefree usage. Suitable for everyday use but to preserve the style of this Christian mug, hand washing is recommended. Not suitable for microwave or dishwasher. This cute inspirational coffee cup is approximately 4 Inches tall and has a 12-ounce capacity. GIFT BOX INCLUDED: Delight friends, family, coworkers, and Christians alike whether they are a tea drinker or a coffee lover with this coffee cup gift. This encouraging mug can be paired with other similarly styled mugs to form a set suitable to bring out on special occasions for a memorable time! Packaged in a coordinating gift box for EASY GIFTING, this inspirational coffee cup makes an easy and useful gift for any occasion. FAITH HOPE & LOVE: Christian Art Gifts offer a variety of Scripture print items. From Bible Covers, Journals, Devotional and Books, the company strives to bring the best quality products with a special message of hope and encouragement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G5kMiKAsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Christian Art Gifts","source_asin":"B082DMPG2L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082DMPG2L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082DMPG2L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
