window.products.push({"id":416540,"name":"MIUXIU Multifunctional Cooking Spoon Gadgets for Skimmer Scoop Colander Strainer,Non-Toxic and High Temperature Resistant,Used for Kitchen Cooking,Fil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mGLUZuI+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The kitchen is where the love of cooking is born. Food, friends, and family are the spice of life. We’re here to make all of it a bit sweeter.   Cooking is a joy.We firmly believe in the power of food. Every dish, whether it ’s for yourself or someone you love, is a warmth. In the world, only love and delicious food can not be let down!   No one is born to be a good cook, but good kitchenware often gets you twice the result with half the effort.   Whether scooping, serving, stirring, or mixing, the can meet all your kitchen needs.   Let's start a wonderful kitchen journey together   Our cooking spoon not only can reach into corner of bowl and pot for best food mash,but also can be as cooking tool when you cook and grate lemons,garlic,ginger,cheese.When you no need,you can hang it on the wall which is easy to store.   Our kitchen spoon is made of non-stick nylon, just wash with dishwashing liquid and water when used finish, no leftovers and juice can stick to this cooking gadget. Heat resistant, it can be washed in the dishwasher. Make your cooking be more easy   -Size: approx. 2.95 x 9.05 inches/7.5 x 23 CM   Pound garlic, grind ginger   Cooking Spoon   These kitchen cooking tools are heat resistant up to 410°F to hold up for most stovetop cooking without melting.   Widely Applications   This multifunctional cooking tool can be used for cooking, draining spoon, grinding and pressing garlic paste, potato masher, bean masher, eggbeater. The small hole design can be applied as a colander, and the other end can also be applied as an ordinary spoon, it is an essential tableware in your kitchen。","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mGLUZuI+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIUXIU","source_asin":"B09NNLR5RH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NNLR5RH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NNLR5RH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
