window.products.push({"id":416674,"name":"SEAVON 85oz Dehumidifiers, Dehumidifiers for Home Up to 700 sq ft, Quiet Portable Dehumidifier for Bedroom Bathroom Basements Closet RV with 2 Working","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51n8n7LKseL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"𝗛𝗶𝗴𝗵 𝗘𝗳𝗳𝗶𝗰𝗶𝗲𝗻𝘁 𝗗𝗲𝗵𝘂𝗺𝗶𝗱𝗶𝗳𝗶𝗰𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻: Equipped with double dehumidification condensers, the dehumidifiers’ dehumidification area reaches up to 700sq.ft. It can quickly and effectively extract up to 34oz of moisture daily in the air (test at temperature: 86°F, humidity: 80%RH). It keeps moisture in your home below 45%. Help you improve the air quality and create a more comfortable and healthier living environment. 𝗔𝘂𝘁𝗼-𝗼𝗳𝗳 𝗗𝗲𝗵𝘂𝗺𝗶𝗱𝗶𝗳𝗶𝗲𝗿: With 85oz water tank, the dehumidifiers for home is perfect for high humidity areas like your living room, bathroom, basement, closet, kitchen. No need to empty the water everyday. Its auto-off function makes it be safe to use even when you are not at home. It will shut off automatically when the water tank is about full of water to protect against the risk of overflow. And the top light will change to be red and flash to remind you draining the tank. 𝗨𝗹𝘁𝗿𝗮-𝗾𝘂𝗶𝗲𝘁 & 𝟮 𝗪𝗼𝗿𝗸𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗠𝗼𝗱𝗲: Designed with powerful mode and quiet mode, the portable dehumidifiers can meet all kinds of dehumidification requirements of different people. You can freely switch between 2 modes. In the quiet mode, it runs ultra-quietly below 30db without annoying sound, let you sleep peacefully. 𝗖𝗼𝗹𝗼𝗿𝗳𝘂𝗹 & 𝗙𝘂𝗻𝗻𝘆 𝗟𝗶𝗴𝗵𝘁𝘀: The electric dehumidifier has 7 color lights with 3 light modes - 7 color changing mode, breathing mode and fixed light mode. You can choose any light mode you like and turn it on on/off at any time in a funny way. Just slightly tap the top light area, the light will be turned on/off. This dehumidifier for bedroom creates a sweet and romantic sleeping atmosphere for you. 𝗖𝗿𝗲𝗮𝘁𝗲 𝗛𝗲𝗮𝗹𝘁𝗵𝘆 & 𝗖𝗼𝗺𝗳𝗼𝗿𝘁𝗮𝗯𝗹𝗲 𝗘𝗻𝘃𝗶𝗿𝗼𝗻𝗺𝗲𝗻𝘁: According to research, if the moisture in the air above 50% can breed uncomfortable or other health problems. Our dehumidifier starts to work when the humidity more than 45%, it collects moisture and releases fresh air, providing you healthy and comfortable environment. The optimal operating temperature is 59-104°F, below 41°F the effect of dehumidification is not obvious. 𝗪𝗮𝗿𝗿𝗮𝗻𝘁𝘆 & 𝗖𝘂𝘀𝘁𝗼𝗺𝗲𝗿 𝗦𝗲𝗿𝘃𝗶𝗰𝗲: SEAVON offer a 1-year warranty of new replacement, 60-day return for full refund, lifetime customer service and tech support for the dehumidifiers. If you have any issues or questions, please email to our Seavon after-sales team firstly, free replacement or refund service will be offered to solve your problem in 24 working hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51n8n7LKseL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEAVON","source_asin":"B0BRZX8D7X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRZX8D7X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRZX8D7X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
