window.products.push({"id":416751,"name":"KIVY Cappuccino cups set of 4 [6oz] - Thick-walled stoneware cappuccino cup set for latte art - Latte mugs - Latte cups - Latte mug - Latte art cup - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x1UwTY7dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THICK-WALLED STONEWARE - In the thick-walled stoneware, the heat is stored for a very long time and thus cappuccino and other hot drinks can be enjoyed longer. HANDCRAFT - Each cappuccino cup is unique and has its own charm. At over 2200°F, the scratch-resistant glazes are fired and give each stoneware cup a unique look. PERFECT SIZE - With a volume of 6 oz, the cappuccino cups set is ideal for latte art, cappuccino, flat white or macchiato. CLASSIC DESIGN - Stoneware latte cup set crafted in a timeless Italian design. Imperfection of glaze and shape create its own character. MATCHING ESPRESSO CUP SETS - Discover other matching products from the Ito Stoneware Collection such as espresso cups, small coffee cups with saucers and other ceramic dinnerware in the KIVY Store on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x1UwTY7dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KIVY","source_asin":"B0BJ7GK29Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ7GK29Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ7GK29Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
