window.products.push({"id":416775,"name":"Huray Rayho Pink Peach Wall Decor for bathroom 3 Pieces Hello Sweet Cheeks Wall Art Canvas Pictures Modern Farmhouse Paintings for bathroom and home w","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kn5lOwhuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PEACH WALL ART FOR BATHROOM – The package comes with 3pcs ready to hang peach bathroom wall arts. Decorate your home with these stylish bathroom pictures. They will fit perfectly and can become a part of the elegant interior of your bathroom. SUITABLE SIZES FOR BATHROOM DECOR -- Each peach wall art sign measures approx. 10’’*8’’*0.5’’. A great choice for hanging above the basin, bathtub, or anywhere in the bathroom. Perfect wall decor for brightening up your bathroom, bedroom, or any space you want. WATERPROOF MATERIAL -- Each canvas panel of beach art is water-resistant, UV resistant, and fading resistant for years indoors. NO framing required, all 3pcs come with black plastic frames, which give each print a modern, finished look. WIDELY APPLICATION -- These adorable peach signs are separate, which you can apply them in a variety of different places, such as the bathroom, bedroom, living room, kitchen, laundry room, door, wall, and these funny signs can brighten your empty walls. WE CARE ABOUT YOUR SATISFACTION -- Fast Amazon logistics and 100% refund service. If you are unsatisfied with your purchase of our peach bathroom wall art decor, you can have a 100% refund without conditions. So love it or your money back!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kn5lOwhuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Huray Rayho","source_asin":"B095LT5J53","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095LT5J53","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095LT5J53","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":416776,"name":"Red For Love by Philippe Sainte-Laudy, 35x35-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":71.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yRAlbrKpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features red flowers. Photographer by passion for years, Philippe took an immediate liking to photographing landscape and nature. Always in search of the best light and the most original angle, he maintains a constant search for the most beautiful places surrounding him. Philippe prides himself in understanding the complex interactions between light, weather, landscape, the tides, plants and animals. He finds it is important to have a deep respect for this planet and its inhabitants. Philippe hopes that his photography can bring people closer to nature and encourage them to preserve it for future generations. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yRAlbrKpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BLX99ES","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BLX99ES","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BLX99ES","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
