window.products.push({"id":416799,"name":"Glintoper Christmas Poinsettia Garland, 5.9 FT Lighted Artificial Garlands with 36 Red Flowers, Battery Operated with Timer Poinsettia String Lights, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xXJneOWWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pre-lit Christmas Poinsettia Garland: Featured by a velvety texture of a realistically silken feel poinsettias and golden leave, this elegant lighted poinsettia garland is taking a very authentic approach to this famous flower. Warm lighting will create a strong festive atmosphere at night. High Quality: Our red Christmas garland made of high quality artificial silk blossoms, accented with golden silk leaves, add a touch of lasting nature to any space. The length of this Christmas garland is 5.9ft. Each contains 36 red Poinsettias equipped with 20 LED warm white lights. Battery Powered: Comes with a battery case and requires 3 AA batteries (not included), which is low consumption and convenient to hang it on everywhere you want, it does not matter if there is no plug nearby. The battery box is not waterproof, please keep away from water. Timer Function: There are a switch on the battery case - ON, OFF, Timer. Comes with built-in auto timer function without setting(6 hrs ON, 18 hrs OFF), to avoid forgetting to turn off the Christmas string lights. Light Up Your Christmas: This beautiful natural-looking garland decorations add elegance to any party, home, classroom, or office. Perfect for Christmas party, wedding, bedroom, garden, balcony, swing stand, shopping malls, mantels, doors, table centerpiece and covered front porch staircase and many other decorations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xXJneOWWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glintoper","source_asin":"B09DKGTXZJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416799","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DKGTXZJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DKGTXZJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":416800,"name":"Unfinished Solid Red Oak Bowl - 2 Sizes Available (9 Inch Bowl)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o4uOX5dvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These unfinished Red Oak hardwood bowls have been used by Decorative Artists, Crafters, Wood burners, Restaurants, Cooking Shops, Weddings and everyone else who needs a sturdy container with the natural warmth of wood. Proudly made in the USA, these hand-turned hardwood bowls are of the highest quality. These make wonderful salad and chopping bowls. Wood Bowls also make excellent surfaces for Decorative Painting, Rosemaling, Tole Painting, or you can use the bowls just as they are. However, if you are using them as salad bowls make sure to protect your hardwood bowls with a salad bowl finish, or season them with mineral oil. Our wood bowls are dried and turned using traditional old world methods. This means that the bowls are turned when \"green\" or wet and then dried. Due to this method no bowls are perfectly round.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o4uOX5dvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holland Bowl Mill","source_asin":"B00PVIH9IM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416800","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PVIH9IM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PVIH9IM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":416801,"name":"Prestee White/Gold Tablecloths, 12pk, 54\"x108\" | Gold Dot Disposable Tablecloths | Plastic Tablecloth | White Tablecloths | Plastic Table Cover | Pape","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uhxXsxQYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elevate any occasion whether casual or formal with these stunning white table cloths from Prestee . Durably crafted from disposable waterproof plastic, they offer the perfect headache-free table covering solution for banquets, catering events, cookouts, weddings, galas, cocktail parties, birthdays, anniversaries and holiday celebrations both large and small. PRODUCT FEATURES: White Plastic Table ClothsPack of 12Fits Tables Up to 8 Ft.Waterproof and Stain ResistantNon-Toxic and OdorlessDisposable and RecyclableRectangular Dimensions: 108” x 54” SOFT NON-SLIP SURFACE Add elegance and class to any dining atmosphere with these large rectangular table covers. A soft, white non-slip surface is not only aesthetically pleasing but helps the table cloths stay put without sliding around. NO STRONG PLASTIC ODOR Prestee brand entertainment and party supplies are crafted to a higher standard than most products on the market. Our table cloths are non-toxic and despite being made from plastic, do not have the unpleasant odor found in other brands and vinyl table cloth alternatives.Enjoy the essence of every mouthwatering mealtime aroma – with none of the nose-wrinkling! HYGIENIC AND ECO-FRIENDLY You’ll benefit from the best of both worlds… here’s why: traditional fabric table cloths are reusable but offer a lower standard of cleanliness and hygiene with use. Ours are disposable but made from eco-friendly plastic that is easily recycled.Host elegant, unforgettable parties and make magical memories that guests will remember for years to come with Prestee tableware and party supplies!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uhxXsxQYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prestee","source_asin":"B0C3WM587L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416801","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3WM587L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3WM587L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
