window.products.push({"id":416839,"name":"Empava 30\" Electric Single Wall Oven Self-cleaning Convection Fan Touch Control in Stainless Steel, 30 Inch, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1609.52,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gov1qXqOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The next high-end US & Canada CSA certified 30-inch electric single wall oven, it’s the real “secret weapon” behind many great meals. Let this high-quality single wall oven give you the utmost in cooking flexibility and help you cook like a professional chef in your own home. Still hesitating? Check out the Empava electric induction or gas cooktop as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gov1qXqOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Empava","source_asin":"B08966WPFN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416839","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08966WPFN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08966WPFN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":416840,"name":"Levtex Home Oscar & Grace Bretton Woods Bretton Woods Quilted Standard Sham (26x20in.) - Reversible - Cotton/Poly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912qs3uuwOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton BRETTON WOODS PILLOW SHAM: A folkloric holiday pillow sham (26x20in.). Designed to finish the look of the Bretton Woods bedding collection, the pillow shams perfectly complement a matching quilt. Extremely versatile, they can also be used alone to give any bed a little bit of holiday cheer. THE BRETTON WOODS DESIGN: One of our most popular collections, Bretton Woods is inspired by traditional Scandinavian folk printing. The front features woodland animals, leaves and holly which reverses to a red and white medallion. A bound border provides contrast and texture to complete the look. SOFT AND COMFORTABLE LUXURY: Made from the softest cotton front, reversing to a microfiber back and quilted with a cotton-rich filler, this sham will never feel heavy, stiff or uncomfortable. The Bretton Woods sham has an ultra soft feel that you'll simply love. It is designed to give your bedroom a feeling of comfort and luxury. Pillow inner not included. EASY CARE: Pre washed for your convenience, the Bretton Woods pillow sham is easy to look after. Simply machine wash on a cold, gentle cycle, then line dry or tumble dry at low temperature. COORDINATE YOUR ROOM DECOR: Create a wonderful bedroom space with our coordinated reversible quilt. The red and white design brings the warmth of the Christmas holiday season into your home and will match a variety of different looks and bedroom decor. You can also freshen your room with other items from the Bretton Woods collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912qs3uuwOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Levtex Home","source_asin":"B08HRFYLVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HRFYLVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HRFYLVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":416841,"name":"Vintage Rv Camping Comfort Bedding Sets Queen Size- Camper Travel Trailers Duvet Cover Set Bedspread for Childrens/Kids/Teens/Adults, 4 Piece,Cotton+P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":105.35,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e2Qjn8JTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Printing: Unique 3D digital Art Print.Color is NOT Easy to fade. Material: Brush Cotton, feel soft and lightweight, Breathable and non-fading,Extremely Durable, long zipper closureAttention Please, actual color may vary from the color on your screen due to monitor color restrictions. If you don't absolutely love the real color,please return the item and keep it in good condition. Care Instruction Machine wash with cold water; Do not bleach; Tumble dry, low heat; Iron, Medium; Do not dry-clean","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e2Qjn8JTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vandarllin","source_asin":"B07FLC88K2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416841","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FLC88K2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FLC88K2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":416842,"name":"Sunshine Joy 3D Twisted Suns Tapestry Tablecloth Wall Art Beach Sheet Huge 60x90 Inches - Amazing 3D Effects","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hXDe6y0zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3D Twisted Suns Tapestry -- Sunshine Joy’s 3-D Tapestries take beautiful, large-scale art and design into another dimension. You stare at your new Sunshine Joy tapestry intently as it hangs on your wall. You marvel at its intricate and well-crafted design and love the beauty it brings to your environment. The colors and artwork are inspiring. One would never expect anything more from this printed fabric. But then, you break out Sunshine Joy’s 3-D Glasses and WOW. You have gone deep down through the rabbit hole and into another dimension. It appears that you can get your hands behind the colors, and it’s fun watching your friends do just that. -- The designs look beautiful to the naked eye and incredible with our 3-D glasses -- In India, they are what locals use as bedcovers. People use them at home for tablecloths, bed-sheets, room dividers, curtains, window treatments, ceiling decor and to quickly cover up. - The corner loops make our tapestries the perfect multipurpose outdoor traveling companion. Secure your picnic sheet . At festivals, stake out an appropriate amount of space for your friends. Tie up a sunscreen at the campsite. Great at the beach as a windproof beach sheet or sun cover-up. 100% Cotton. Our tapestries are printed, not quilted or woven. They are hippie Indian tapestries. Thin as sheet. Good, tight power loom construction. Hemmed edges. The printing process is unique to India. Each tapestry has its unique imperfections. Sunshine Joy's tapestries are printed with a special soft fiber reactive dye. This is the same soft feeling of your favorite tie-dyed T-shirt. Some colors may show through the back side to give the impression that they are double sided with one side lighter than the other. Actually, they are only printed on one side. -- Size is approximately 5 feet by 7.5 feet. 60 inches by 90 inches 152 centimeters by 228 centimeters 1.52 meters by 2.28 meters. Fits a twin XL college dorm bed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hXDe6y0zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunshine Joy","source_asin":"B01DOHHGTI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416842","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DOHHGTI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DOHHGTI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
