window.products.push({"id":416876,"name":"Molgree Springform Pans, 3pcs (7\" 9\" 11\") Nonstick Leakproof Cheesecake Pan Springform Pan Set with Removable Bottom, Spring Form Pans Round Cake Pans","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FRyT7A2yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM SPRINGFORM PANS - The springform pan set include 3pcs nonstick springform pans (7 inch, 9 inch, 11 inch) and 60pcs (each size 20pcs) pre-cutted parchment paper liners, 1pcs icing smoother and 1pcs washing sponge. The round cake pans sets for baking are perfect to bake cheesecakes, mousse, pizzas, quiches, ice-cream cakes, lasagnas, three layer cakes suited for any occasion. QUALITY CHEESECAKE PAN - The cheesecake pan is made of a strong, durable, bent-proof carbon steel, BPA free, the honeycomb textured base ensures even heat flow, which means beginners can bake perfect cakes without ever worrying about over and underbaking. The spring form pan is not only oven safe, but also pressure cooker and instant pot compatible. Heatproof up To 450F. DOUBLE LAYER NONSTICK - Springform cake pan with double layer food grade nonstick technology that helps cake retain their shape, no flowering needed, meaning you don’t have to worry about scraping out once it is cooked, it will easily leave the spring pan and onto your plate. The springform baking pan is super easy to clean, and long lasting. dishwasher safe, hand washing recommended. QUICK-RELEASE AND REMOVABLE BOTTOM - The springform pans has a strong yet easy to open latch that helps you pop out the cake with the slightest push, then seals up tight when needed. The cake pans bottom can be removable quickly, which allows your cake be released from cheesecake pan more cleanly without destroying the shape. Better quality results than other cake form. NO HASSLE, MOLGREE GUARANTEE - We’re confident that you’ll love our springform pans as much as we do. If you are disappointed with our spring form pans for baking, we’ll give you 100% products replacement or refund guarantee. There is no risk for you, so give our springform pans a try. You won’t regret it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FRyT7A2yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Molgree","source_asin":"B082Y545WX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416876","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082Y545WX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082Y545WX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
