window.products.push({"id":416957,"name":"Senweit Premium Vacuum Sealer Machine, Food Sealer for Kitchen with Vacuum Bags, Red Z Style Mini Food Sealer, Lower Noise, Lossless Sealing, Lighter,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x9BdCOtVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MUST PAY ATTENTION: - This type of vacuum machine, including those sold by other businesses, must use a special vacuum pattern bag or a folding bag with a thickness of 20 threads or more before it can be used in vacuum. Ordinary bags cannot be vacuumed and can only be sealed, and aluminum foil bags cannot be used. - This type of vacuum machine, including products from other businesses, cannot pack pure liquids. - Do not fill the vacuum bag full. Leave enough space at the open end of the bag to allow the bag to enter the vacuum chamber more safely. - Do not wet the open end of the bag. Wet bags can be difficult to melt and tightly seal. - Do not vacuum with sharp objects, such as hard shells. - After each seal or vacuum seal, let the vacuum packaging machine stand for a minutes. - If you have any problem, Please kindly contact our customer service, we will deal with it within 24 hours.INSTRUCTIONS OF THE SEALER MACHINE: - Put the food into the bag, straighten the bag, remove dust and smooth wrinkles. - Place the open end of the bag into the vacuum chamber under the air inlet of the machine. - Press the top cover with your palm, then press the sides of the cover to lock the upper case.- Select the mode and press the button.- Press the vacuum seal button. When the LED turns red, the bag will automatically seal. When the LED turns green again, the process is complete. - After completing the sealing, simultaneously press the left and right locks, open the lid, and remove the food.Technical Specs: - Name:Vacuum sealer machine - Power: 90 W - Rated voltage: AC100 - 240V / 50 - 60HZ - Degree of vacuum: 60 Kpa","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x9BdCOtVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Senweit","source_asin":"B092TYD8RD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-416957","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092TYD8RD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092TYD8RD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
